      "steps": [
        "Name the civic idea or rule.",
        "Explain what responsible behaviour looks like.",
        "Give a real school/community/Jamaican example.",
        "Explain how that action supports others or the country."
      ],
      "commonMistakes": [
        "Naming a right or value but forgetting the responsibility or real action that goes with it."
      ],
